{"text":{"en":{"패킹 MYA형":"Packing MYA Type","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Packing MYA Type</p> <h2>패킹 MYA형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">패킹 MYA형</strong>입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Packing MYA Type</p> <h2>Packing MYA Type</h2> <p>Packing MYA Type is <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">used for both piston and rod applications</strong>.</p>","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/packing_mya_diagram.webp?v=wm2\" alt=\"패킹 MYA형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이</span></p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/packing_mya_diagram.webp?v=wm2\" alt=\"Packing MYA Type drawing\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Cross-section<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=Inner diameter · D=Outer diameter · H=Height</span></p>","서울 구로구 경인로53길 32, 미래에코타워 B101·102호":"B101–102, Mirae Eco Tower, 32 Gyeongin-ro 53-gil, Guro-gu, Seoul"},"ja":{"패킹 MYA형":"パッキンMYA型","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Packing MYA Type</p> <h2>패킹 MYA형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">패킹 MYA형</strong>입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Packing MYA Type</p> <h2>パッキンMYA型</h2> <p>ピストン・ロッド兼用として使用する<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">パッキンMYA型</strong>です。</p>","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/packing_mya_diagram.webp?v=wm2\" alt=\"패킹 MYA형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이</span></p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/packing_mya_diagram.webp?v=wm2\" alt=\"パッキンMYA型図面\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 断面図<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=内径・D=外径・H=高さ</span></p>","서울 구로구 경인로53길 32, 미래에코타워 B101·102호":"ソウル特別市九老区京